##################################################
# NOTES & IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS
##################################################

### Caching
# Analytics endpoints implement Redis-based caching with automatic invalidation
# Cache TTL varies by endpoint: 5-15 minutes for most endpoints
# Cache is invalidated on quiz submissions and word updates

### Rate Limiting
# Analytics endpoints have generous rate limits (100 req/min per user)
# Error reporting has stricter limits: 3/hour (free), 10/hour (premium)

### Performance
# All analytics queries include performance optimizations:
# - Response time filtering (200ms-30s range)
# - Database indexes on analytics tables  
# - Materialized views for complex aggregations
# - Pagination for large datasets

### Data Quality
# Recent fixes (January 2025) addressed:
# - Streak calculation accuracy (gap-and-islands logic)
# - Box distribution consistency (MAX vs MIN box_id)
# - Word count accuracy (LEFT JOIN for all words)
# - Response time outlier filtering

### Authentication
# All endpoints require valid JWT token in Authorization header
# Tokens expire after 24 hours and auto-refresh on activity

### Error Responses
# 400: Invalid parameters (wordlist ID format, days range)
# 401: Missing or invalid authentication token
# 404: Wordlist not found or not owned by user
# 429: Rate limit exceeded
# 500: Internal server error

###